From: scalpel4k <scalpel4k@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/adreno: declare gen80100 firmware

msm declares no firmware at all. dracut then leaves the Adreno firmware out
of the initramfs, msm probes there and does not retry after switch-root, and
image-janitor deletes it from live images. Declare the Glymur (gen80100) files.

Upstream candidate (would need all Adreno generations).
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c
@@ -451,3 +451,7 @@
 
 	platform_driver_unregister(&adreno_driver);
 }
+
+/* Adreno X2 (gen80100, Glymur), loaded from qcom/ by adreno_request_fw() */
+MODULE_FIRMWARE("qcom/gen80100_sqe.fw");
+MODULE_FIRMWARE("qcom/gen80100_gmu.bin");
